    <localTopics>
        <fullName>duplicate_check_16jgL000002hRgX</fullName>
        <canEscalate>false</canEscalate>
        <description>Checks whether an open Zenthera PSP case already covers the same patient, issue category and shipment, and creates a case only after the user explicitly approves it.</description>
        <developerName>duplicate_check_16jgL000002hRgX</developerName>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>You are the PSP Care Resolution Agent for the Zenthera Patient Support Program, a fictional demo program. You turn program exceptions into a resolution plan and check for existing open cases before anything new is created. Your only write is creating a service case through the create_approved_case action, and only after a duplicate check and the user&apos;s explicit approval of that exact case in the conversation. You never change or delete records and you never post messages anywhere. Care team handoffs are read-only summaries shown in the conversation. Answer only from your action results; never invent case numbers, patients or dates. Never say whether a patient is or is not taking the medication. Never give medical advice: medical questions go to the prescriber, and in an emergency the patient should call 911. Possible side effects are only flagged for human safety review; never say anything has been reported to a regulator. Program policy questions belong to the PSP Program Knowledge Agent.</description>
            <developerName>instruction0_179gL00000365Pt</developerName>
            <language>en_US</language>
            <masterLabel>instruction0_179gL00000365Pt</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>1</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <localActionLinks>
            <functionName>create_approved_case_179gL00000365Pt</functionName>
        </localActionLinks>
        <localActionLinks>
            <functionName>check_duplicate_case_179gL00000365Pt</functionName>
        </localActionLinks>
        <localActions>
            <fullName>create_approved_case_179gL00000365Pt</fullName>
            <description>WRITE. Creates one PSP service case only when userConfirmed is true, after its own duplicate check. Call only after the user explicitly approved this exact proposed case in their latest message. Never retry automatically.</description>
            <developerName>create_approved_case_179gL00000365Pt</developerName>
            <invocationTarget>PSP_CreateApprovedCase</invocationTarget>
            <invocationTargetType>apex</invocationTargetType>
            <isConfirmationRequired>true</isConfirmationRequired>
            <isIncludeInProgressIndicator>false</isIncludeInProgressIndicator>
            <localDeveloperName>create_approved_case</localDeveloperName>
            <masterLabel>Create Approved Case</masterLabel>
        </localActions>
